{"id": "sdqa0142", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2908478396, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "55d54790f4984a1399d890ed29cf337bf030dd977d2cbf354d2e7727784c1c44", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 2, "query": "What is the population of Rio, Brazil?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0142.wav", "input_sha256": "e1cf4d7702cccca813e8f9f7e4d1a8631b7fcf10820ac23e2c188b7d39657c6c", "input_samples": 60870, "input_s": 3.804, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.641, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The city/municipality of Rio de Janeiro, Brazil has a population of 6,211,423 according to Brazil’s 2022 Census by IBGE. (ibge.gov.br) If you mean Rio de Janeiro state, its population is 16,055,174. (ibge.gov.br)", "expert_answer": "The **city/municipality of Rio de Janeiro, Brazil** has a population of **6,211,423** according to Brazil’s **2022 Census** by IBGE. ([ibge.gov.br](https://www.ibge.gov.br/cidades-e-estados/rj/rio-de-janeiro.html?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you mean **Rio de Janeiro state**, its population is **16,055,174**. ([ibge.gov.br](https://www.ibge.gov.br/biblioteca/visualizacao/periodicos/3102/cd_2022_populacao_idade_sexo_rj.pdf?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "What is the population of Rio, Brazil?\n", "asr_s": 0.51, "expert_s": 6.26, "expert_input_samples": 60870, "expert_input_s": 3.804, "expert_input_sha256": "e1cf4d7702cccca813e8f9f7e4d1a8631b7fcf10820ac23e2c188b7d39657c6c", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 5.375, "relay_synth_ms": 13769, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0142_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "4327bee8b98c